  "text": "Dictation should fit the way you work. Meet Mluva, the most delightful dictation app for Omachi. Best of local and cloud. F9, talk and paste. Omachi moves like water. Tile it or let it float. Done talking? Edit it, polish it, rewrite it. Find your thoughts again, your desktop, your palette, any Omachi theme automatically. Try live rewrite. Keep speaking as your text takes shape or build a task spec with questions for what's still missing. A little more delight every day.",
